  m_text: 'You are equipped with a mask.

    Your mask has three modules that you
    can swap during the game.

    Each module helps you with different abilities.


    Default
    mask: the basic mask with no special abilities

    Sonar mask: use it to locate
    fuel tanks

    Lumen mask: lights the surrounding area, useful in dark waters'
